      "rationale": "Kĩhibirania gĩtirĩ kĩgunyi kĩa 'nĩ' harĩ 'ngoro yake mĩtaro' — Gĩkũyũ kĩagĩrĩirwo kĩgunyi"
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "מצודים\/ילכד",
      "rationale": "Mĩtaro na kũcigwa — kiugo kĩmwe kĩorotagia kĩrĩa kĩngĩ: mũhoko agĩcigwo harĩ mĩtaro ĩrĩa ĩrũngĩrĩirio"
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "mũndũmũri",
      "rationale": "Kiugo kĩonekaga ta ũrĩa kwa mũndũmũri o wothe kana mũndũmũri ũmwe ũrĩa mũtarathi amenetwo nĩyo; atĩri a magana mothe maingĩ metĩkĩtie mbũtũ ĩrĩa ĩkonanie"
    },
    {
      "kind": "alternative",
      "subject": "טוב לפני האלהים",
      "rationale": "Kwĩrĩ 'ũrĩa Erohimu aendera' kana 'mũndũ mwega mbere ya Erohimu' — gĩkunĩ kĩa kwenderwa nĩ Ngai"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na nĩnguukire kĩneno kũrĩ kũua kwa mũndũ: ⟨את⟩ mũndũmũri, ũrĩa we nĩ mĩtaro na minyũngũ; ngoro yake ⟨nĩ⟩ mĩtaro, makonyo make ⟨nĩ⟩ mĩhianyo; mũndũ mwega mbere ya Erohimu nĩakũhiurũka kũrĩ we, no mũhoko agĩcigwo nĩyo.",
